OL,3,GNEWSAWildfires left service close to
OL,4,A'major incident'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeicestershire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,7,Fwas close to declaring a major incident
OL,8,Ffollowing a series of wildfires, its
OL,9,Fchief fire officer has said.
OL,11,FCallum Faint said crews had been
OL,12,F"consistently stretched" over the last
OL,13,Ftwo and half months as heatwaves and
OL,14,Fdrought conditions put fire services
OL,15,Facross the country under unprecedented
OL,16,Fpressure.
OL,18,FFour firefighters suffered heat-related
OL,19,Finjuries as the service responded to
OL,20,Fthree separate wildfires in
OL,21,FLeicestershire on 13 August.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
