OL,3,GNEWSAWildfires left service close to
OL,4,A'major incident'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFaint said: "I can confidently say in
OL,7,Fmy 31 years of service this has been
OL,8,Fthe busiest summer for Leicestershire
OL,9,FFire and Rescue Service."
